OptionValue UH_ClassMainfire
{
0, "\cdCan be overcharged"//MegaMan
1, "\cdFires random effect balls"//Qwant
2, "\cdCan be charged"//NegaMan
3, "\cdCan be fired during altfire"//BusterExpert
4, "\cuNo Tips"//BusterMistress
5, "\cuNo Tips"//GreatShielder
6, "\cdCan be overcharged\nCharge shots do random effects"//LuckyLass
7, "\cuNo Tips"//Quickster
8, "\cdRelease to detonate shot\nDoes more damage on detonate"//TacticalBomber
9, "\cdCharges while not firing"//FrostBite
10, "\cdCharges while not firing"//Igniter
11, "\cuNo Tips"//CloseCombatUnit
12, "\cdStronger shots uses more ammo\n\cjFast direct shot \cd- \cuHoming explosion\n\cgShotgun shot \cd- \cvFloor mine shot"//Arcanist
13, "\cdMiddle shot pushes when red, pulls when blue"//HomingSeeker
14, "\cdStronger shot fired when invisible"//Trickster
15, "\cdLower health increases shots"//RageUnit
16, "\cdWeaker shots when out of ammo"//HeavyGunner
17, "\cdBlade can bounce twice\n\ciThrows a poisonous dagger"//Raider
18, "\cdShots ignore most shields"//FlightUnit
19, "\cuNo Tips"//HeavyBomber
20, "\cdStronger shots based on ammo\n75% and 100% shots can stun\n100% shot also explodes"//Electrician
21, "\cdPistol has infinite ammo\n\ciOther weapons have ammo limits\n\cqZword shot can block shots"//Slugger
22, "\cdHoming shot stuns\nBuster shots cause hitstun"//Saboteur
23, "\cdRail gets stronger with ammo"//StealthSniper
24, "\cdSlash follows your movement"//TangoGirl
25, "\cdBeer goes further with more ammo\nCauses sticky feet on hit"//BeerMan
26, "\cdOne shot is always straight\nShots become rippers when near trees"//TreeHugger
27, "\cdWhirlwind slides on floors"//GloryGuster
28, "\cdSix fast shots that launch smoke\nThe final shot fires three bullets\nThe shots can ricochet the smoke"//SmokeBandit
29, "\cdBlades can bounce four times\nDamage increases after first bounce"//TheDentist
30, "\cdExplosive shot with limited bouncing"//Trapist
31, "\cdShots bounce forward on floor touch"//AeroUnit
32, "\cdMore charge, more damage"//Rameses
33, "\cdSwipe across the screen to slash\nOtherwise no swipe does a strong stab"//SamuraiSam
34, "\cdCan be charged"//Astronaut
35, "\cdEach block is different\n\cvI explodes \chJ sticks \ciL rips \ckO splits\n\cdS stuns \ctT bounces \cgZ powerfully slow"//SiteWorker
36, "\cdLeaps and slams foes\nCan jump for more height"//SumoWrestler
37, "\cdFires a laser of water\n\ciPlaces a floating mine\nThis mine can be pushed"//TidalManiac
38, "\cdCharged shot knocks foes away\nThis shot also rocket jumps the user\nAltfire during charging to autofire"//Tristana
39, "\cdWhen empowered, toss a random present\nDoes x1, x2, x3 damage, or heals everyone"//PartyBomber
40, "\cdFire a string of 3 shots\nHit all 3 for a bonus explosion"//Marksman
41, "\cuNo Tips"//HandyMan
42, "\cdPress once to fire, press again to detonate\nStuns once the barrel starts flashing\nDamage increases after every flash"//CaptainAss
43, "\cdAfter a melee swipe, hold to rapid fire"//Lim
44, "\cdFires shots based on charge\nCan mix shots in anyway"//RedWarrior
45, "\cdFires a spread of shots\n\ciSlashes rapidly"//BlueValkyrie
46, "\cdFires a volley of fireballs\n\ciShots bounce when empowered\n\cqTriple shot when empowered"//YellowWizard
47, "\cdCan be charged to fire more arrows"//GreenElf
48, "\cuNo Tips"//Juggernaut
49, "\cdFires forgotten attacks"//Archivist
50, "\cdFires attacks from other classes\nMost attacks are exactly the same"//DecoyBot
51, "\cdDashes and grabs foes\nHolding jump grabs midair only"//Zangief
52, "\cdCan be charged\nFlings on direct hit\nCan also block projectiles"//Amber
53, "\cdThrows a bouncing, returning blade\n\ciStabs at foes\nDoes severe damage on backstab"//Kate
54, "\cdShots get weaker with distance\nAccuracy is based on ammo left"//Claire
55, "\cdToss up to 3 boomerang fireballs\nThe shots can go through walls\nDoes light damage and adds burn stacks"//Wisp
56, "\cdCan charged to do spin attack\n\ciA weak bullet with extra hitstun"//Miu
57, "\ciActivates all ghost traps"//GhostBuster
58, "\cdPerform a spinning attack\nYou have no gravity only once in the air\nUse it to stall or position for a kick"//KickChamp
59, "\cdFires tears modified by passive items\nStats and tears randomize each round"//Eden
60, "\cdCharge to fire a detonatable crystal\nPress again to detonate into shards\nAltfire at full charge for rapid barrage"//Crystrap
}


OptionValue UH_ClassAltfire
{
0, "\cdTrade buster power for more weapons"//MegaMan
1, "\cdFire balls in specific order\nRerolls current weapon on moves\nCannot reroll base weapon"//Qwant
2, "\cdFly forward with a kick"//NegaMan
3, "\cdCan be fired at all times\nLaunches user backwards"//BusterExpert
4, "\cdClone fires when user fires"//BusterMistress
5, "\cdDash stuns enemies"//GreatShielder
6, "\cdFires a shot with varying power\n\caRandomized number of 1 ~ 9"//LuckyLass
7, "\cdLaunch a fist with knockback\nThis resets vertical velocity\nWithout ammo, rapidly punch"//Quickster
8, "\cdPress once to fire, press again to detonate"//TacticalBomber
9, "\cdRipper shots that slow foes on hit"//FrostBite
10, "\cdSticks to surfaces"//Igniter
11, "\cdDashes doing a stunning ram\nCan be ended early with mainfire"//CloseCombatUnit
12, "\cdToggle through power levels"//Arcanist
13, "\cdChange your polarity"//HomingSeeker
14, "\cdTurns user invisible"//Trickster
15, "\cdFlings foes away\nLower health flings more"//RageUnit
16, "\cdExplosive leap upward\nHas a cooldown before reuse"//HeavyGunner
17, "\cdHookshots onto objects\n\ciSlashes a poisonous dagger"//Raider
18, "\cdFires a missile with knockback\nCan be rapid fired"//FlightUnit
19, "\cdVolley of missiles with flight"//HeavyBomber
20, "\cdA constant short range lightning rail"//Electrician
21, "\cdTosses a random weapon crate\nCrate contains either a Machine Gun\nRocket Launcher, Shotgun, or Zword"//Slugger
22, "\cdDelayed mainfire shots"//Saboteur
23, "\cdDash back and toss a flashbang\nThis shortly blinds foes"//StealthSniper
24, "\cdDashes forward and can latch onto players\nHolding jump prevents latching\nWhen latched, you deal less melee damage"//TangoGirl
25, "\cdFires a beer wave\nCauses sticky feet on hit"//BeerMan
26, "\cdLaunch a seed to become a tree\nTrees heal everyone who is near"//TreeHugger
27, "\cdTossed shot splits into tornados"//GloryGuster
28, "\cdCan be fired at all times\nTosses a mine that arms on floor touch\nThe mine causes strong hitstun on contact"//SmokeBandit
29, "\cdFires drill that explodes\nExplosion unleashes mouthwash"//TheDentist
30, "\cdWhen charged, toss a trap to snare enemies\nOtherwise, fire a mine that can be detonated\nThe blast launches the user or foes away\nThe mine fling changes if midair or attached"//Trapist
31, "\cdHeavy ripping shot that does massive damage"//AeroUnit
32, "\cdWave can go through walls"//Rameses
33, "\cdPerforms a dodge roll\nAvoids most damage and gives speed"//SamuraiSam
34, "\cdHovers with increased speed"//Astronaut
35, "\cdBlock drops where user points\nAlso changes held block"//SiteWorker
36, "\cdCan be charged\nWave clips up floors\nPress while leaping to slam down"//SumoWrestler
37, "\cdSummons shield to give benefits\nDoes constant damage to foes\nIncreased fire rate for main"//TidalManiac
38, "\cdTosses a sticky mine\nAny Tristana damage charges the mine"//Tristana
39, "\cdAfter a second of wind up, charge forward\nCollision launches self/empowers mainfire"//PartyBomber
40, "\cdCan mark up to 7 enemies\nFires homing shots at all marked foes"//Marksman
41, "\cdLift off to slam into the ground\nSlam gets stronger the longer in the air\nMain/Alt control thrust"//HandyMan
42, "\cdLeave a trail of bombs as you dash"//CaptainAss
43, "\cdEnters defensive stance on use\nUnleashes charged energy afterwards\nCannot move during use"//Lim
44, "\ciReflective \cj- \ckSpeed\n\cdPower \cj- \cvPierce\n\chExplosive \cj- \ctHoming"//RedWarrior
45, "\cdExplosive shots with knockback\n\ciStrong slash forward"//BlueValkyrie
46, "\cgHeals user \cj- \ckShort invincibility\n\chExplosive potion, kills create food\n\ctShort invisibility"//YellowWizard
47, "\cdDo a short range melee stab\nCan aim dash while charging"//GreenElf
48, "\cdRams forward at great speeds"//Juggernaut
49, "\cdFires forgotten attacks\nBallade shot time stops foes"//Archivist
50, "\cdRerolls your three attacks"//DecoyBot
51, "\cdPerforms a double lariat\nDodges projectiles during use\nHold to charge a strong grab"//Zangief
52, "\cdDash forward, can attack during dash"//Amber
53, "\cdTurn invisible\nAltfire dashes out of invisibility"//Kate
54, "\cdPerform a dash based on movement keys\nNo movement boosts you higher\nCan be used anytime"//Claire
55, "\cdNo charge, beam that ignores walls\nOn hit, burns all stacks for bonus damage\nCharged, spawns a flame portal\nReuse fires a beam and teleports to portal"//Wisp
56, "\cdBubble dashes forward three times\n\ciBomb that splits into smaller bombs"//Miu
57, "\cdFires condensed shots\n\ciTosses a ghost trap"//GhostBuster
58, "\cdSlide forward for light damage\nCan super jump out of a slide\nHold jump before alt to dive kick"//KickChamp
59, "\cdUses your starting active item\nRecharges through cooldown or combat"//Eden
60, "\cdDeploys a surveillance crystal eye\nReuse to spy through the crystal eye"//Crystrap
}


